1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:13,360 --> 00:02:14,600
What is this ?

25
00:02:29,760 --> 00:02:32,920
Heaven Defying Space
inside the Heaven Defying Bead

26
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:42,710
Where... am I ?

27
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,710
Finally...

28
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:47,430
This day

29
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:50,350
has arrived !

30
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:54,400
Situ Nan's
Origin Soul

31
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,830
My physical body was destroyed

32
00:02:56,840 --> 00:03:00,270
and my Origin Soul has been trapped in here for thousands of years !

33
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:01,710
But now...

34
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:04,550
I'll finally regain my freedom !

35
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:05,830
You...

36
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:07,430
Your fate

37
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,710
is to become my new body !

38
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:29,040
How is this possible ?!

39
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,680
How long does this senior plan on trying ?

40
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,310
A mortal...

41
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:57,670
I waited thousands of years

42
00:03:57,680 --> 00:04:00,240
for a mortal like you to find me !

43
00:04:00,280 --> 00:04:02,800
I can't even possess you !

44
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:11,760
The Heaven Defying Bead really chose someone

45
00:04:11,760 --> 00:04:13,310
with mediocre talent.

46
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,960
If I wait for him to be able to take me out,

47
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,360
planet Suzaku will already have returned to dust !

48
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,640
Junior's name is Wang Lin.

49
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,120
I want to become an Immortal.

50
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:24,800
Why doesn't Senior help me to cultivate

51
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,990
so I can help you to escape.

52
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,430
Your talent is mediocre !

53
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,230
Talent...

54
00:04:31,080 --> 00:04:31,950
Talent...

55
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,200
I was born ordinary

56
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,000
but I am not fated to stay ordinary !

57
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,350
You don't know your limits.

58
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:47,780
Note: Several days have passed, the sect thinks Wang Lin disappeared and made a suicide attempt after his failure.

59
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,400
Tie Zhu !

60
00:04:41,520 --> 00:04:44,150
Where are you, Tie Zhu ?

61
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:52,630
Tie Zhu !

62
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:55,790
Why would you do something so foolish !?

63
00:04:55,840 --> 00:04:56,750
Wang Lin,

64
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,310
the Sect Leader admires your perseverance

65
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:02,270
and made an exception to accept you as an outer disciple.

66
00:05:07,880 --> 00:05:09,630
What ? Are you not willing ?

67
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:14,830
Disciple Wang Lin will follow your teachings

68
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,750
and cultivate diligently.

69
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,990
Zhang Kuang, take him back to the sect.

70
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:18,550
Sure.

71
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,470
Let's go.

72
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:34,750
Tie Zhu...

73
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:38,630
Father,

74
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:39,830
Tie Zhu...

75
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,430
Mother...

76
00:05:42,240 --> 00:05:44,350
I won't disappoint you.

77
00:05:54,760 --> 00:05:55,790
In our sect

78
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,550
the color of your robe

79
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,670
represents your status.

80
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,640
White is the highest

81
00:06:01,680 --> 00:06:04,150
followed by red and yellow.

82
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,070
Senior Brother.

83
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:08,000
Outer Disciples Work Hall
Heng Yue Sect

84
00:06:06,040 --> 00:06:07,200
Then...

85
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:08,720
what rank are gray robes ?

86
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,550
They're outer disciples,

87
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,800
they aren't counted as inner sect disciples.

88
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:14,950
Brother Zhang !

89
00:06:14,960 --> 00:06:16,920
What brings you here today ?

90
00:06:13,480 --> 00:06:15,080
Liu Shulang
Heng Yue Sect disciple
1st layer of Qi Condensation

91
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,030
Stay safe Brother Zhang !

92
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,550
Just follow my lead and bet big !

93
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,670
Go, go, go !

94
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,470
Again, again, again !

95
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,230
Bet big !

96
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,110
What ?

97
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,640
Do you expect me to fetch your bedding for you ?

98
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,400
Yes, yes, yes !

99
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,270
I told you to bet big !

100
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,190
Ouch !

101
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:47,040
I heard you got in by attempting suicide.

102
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:48,750
You've got some nerve, kid.

103
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,430
This round I bet big !

104
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,630
It's either big or small anyway !

105
00:06:53,840 --> 00:06:54,430
Senior Brother,

106
00:06:54,960 --> 00:06:55,830
where do I live ?

107
00:06:57,760 --> 00:06:59,030
It's just a place to sleep,

108
00:06:59,040 --> 00:06:59,950
don't overthink.

109
00:07:00,440 --> 00:07:00,950
Here.

110
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:06,000
Zhang Hu
Heng Yue Sect outer disciple

111
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,920
I'm Zhang Hu,

112
00:07:04,960 --> 00:07:06,640
ask me if you have any questions.

113
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:10,430
Alright, hurry up !

114
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,110
These are tomorrow's tasks.

115
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,520
Finally, they're here !

116
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,190
This one's mine !

117
00:07:19,040 --> 00:07:20,320
No switching !

118
00:07:20,760 --> 00:07:21,510
Yours is so easy,

119
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:22,630
look at mine !

120
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,630
Same rules as always,

121
00:07:25,160 --> 00:07:27,280
if you fail to finish the task in 7 days,

122
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,910
I'll report to the Elders

123
00:07:28,920 --> 00:07:30,390
and you'll be expelled from the sect.

124
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,950
Yes, Senior Brother.

125
00:07:34,360 --> 00:07:35,270
After I finish the task,

126
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:36,390
can I cultivate ?

127
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:38,550
Cultivate ?

128
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,470
Cultivate..?

129
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,790
You're better off sleeping.

130
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:44,640
He really thinks he will finish early ?

131
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,480
Senior Brother Zhang Hu,

132
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,750
why was the red task the last one left ?

133
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:56,440
Is fetching water that hard ?

134
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,310
You'll find out tomorrow.

135
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:03,320
Rear mountain of
the Heng Yue Sect

136
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,070
It's alright,

137
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,630
I still have 6 days.

138
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,430
If I work harder,

139
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,510
I can do it.

140
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,160
Can it really heal injuries ?

141
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,400
I feel so light.

142
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:37,320
Even water the Heaven Defying Bead was soaked into has effects.

143
00:09:39,080 --> 00:09:43,550
Although the outer disciples have low status,

144
00:09:43,560 --> 00:09:47,230
they still roam these spiritual mountains all day.

145
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:49,270
Who knows what treasures they might find ?

146
00:09:50,040 --> 00:09:52,870
It would be a waste to leave it to them.

147
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:56,350
We should take it for ourselves.

148
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,680
It's all for the Dao of immortality.

149
00:09:58,760 --> 00:10:01,920
Don’t worry, I'll give you any treasure they find.

150
00:10:11,280 --> 00:10:15,070
Dew is the essence of water, let’s try with it.

151
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:42,110
The effect of dew is even better !

152
00:10:44,800 --> 00:10:46,150
Not bad.

153
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:49,480
This kid actually upgraded the water element of the Heaven Defying Bead.

154
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,390
It's only been 4 days

155
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:14,070
and he's almost done ?

156
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:16,520
This kid is definitely suspicious.

157
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,880
What’s going on ?

158
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,070
Senior Brother Liu...

159
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,350
Where have you hidden your treasure ?

160
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,470
What treasure ?

161
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,030
I don’t understand what you mean.

162
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,960
Don't you dare lie to me !

163
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,030
Remember

164
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,910
that as long as you’re in the Heng Yue Sect,

165
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:53,470
you’ll be beneath me !

166
00:11:53,920 --> 00:11:55,870
Don't you dare hide treasures from me !

167
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,020
Hmph!

168
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:03,990
Wang Lin !

169
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,430
You fool ! Why didn’t you fight back !?

170
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:13,150
I remember everything he did to me.

171
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:15,960
As long as I become an Immortal,

172
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:17,110
I can wait.

173
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:18,350
But I can’t wait !

174
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:21,320
From now on, I’ll teach you cultivation.

175
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:23,560
Why are you laughing ?

176
00:12:23,760 --> 00:12:24,750
It's nothing,

177
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,670
I was worried Senior would abandon me for someone else.

178
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,360
Do you think I don’t want to ?

179
00:12:30,360 --> 00:12:32,880
But the damn Heaven Defying Bead chose you !

180
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:36,230
I’ll strengthen your Spirit Root first.

181
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:40,270
How many clouds are there on the Heaven Defying Bead ?

182
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:41,550
Nine.

183
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:43,470
So one more is missing

184
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:45,110
before you can start cultivating.

185
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,920
The Heng Yue Sect’s spiritual energy is thin,

186
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:49,520
but it's better than nothing.

187
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,230
Keep collecting dew

188
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,750
and upgrade the Heaven Defying Bead.

189
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:55,150
Senior Situ,

190
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:56,670
thank you.

191
00:12:58,690 --> 00:13:29,630
Note: Cultivation is born from real Daoism, Buddhism and Confucianism. It's internal alchemy. Instead of swallowing mercury to try to become immortal, you breathe and meditate to absorb spiritual energy and use your own body as a furnace to create the true elixir of immortality: the Golden Core.

192
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:35,360
The realms of the first step of cultivation are:

193
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:36,760
Qi Condensation,

194
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,280
Foundation Establishment,

195
00:13:38,440 --> 00:13:39,720
Core Formation,

196
00:13:39,960 --> 00:13:41,080
Nascent Soul,

197
00:13:41,360 --> 00:13:42,360
Soul Formation,

198
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,560
Soul Transformation,

199
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,710
and Ascendant.

200
00:13:35,400 --> 00:13:45,720
Note: Refer to the cultivation level cheat sheet if needed.

201
00:13:46,840 --> 00:13:48,640
Let's start with the chants for the

202
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:50,600
first 3 layers of Qi Condensation.

203
00:13:57,520 --> 00:13:59,110
Focus on your breathing !

204
00:14:02,040 --> 00:14:04,960
10 hours inside the bead is only 1 hour outside.

205
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:08,190
Time in the Heaven Defying Space flows 10 times faster.

206
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,590
This will buy your mortal body

207
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:12,510
more time to cultivate.

208
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:17,520
6 months later

209
00:14:17,400 --> 00:14:20,880
Senior Brother Liu has been preparing the Sect Competition

210
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:22,760
so he doesn't have time to harass us anymore.

211
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:25,910
The Xuan Dao Sect pretends to be friendly

212
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,830
but they’ve always been our rivals.

213
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:30,310
In the last few competitions,

214
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,710
they won every match.

215
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,190
We must be prepared.

216
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:39,470
The competition with the Xuan Dao Sect is coming.

217
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,750
Elder Sun will select one of you

218
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:44,630
to become an inner disciple.

219
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,190
Me ! Pick me !

220
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:47,720
Choose me !

221
00:14:51,520 --> 00:14:53,070
Choose me !

222
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:55,670
Me ! Me !

223
00:14:59,760 --> 00:15:00,630
Wang Lin,

224
00:15:01,080 --> 00:15:02,270
although you lack talent,

225
00:15:02,800 --> 00:15:04,670
your perseverance is exceptional.

226
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:07,230
Will you become my disciple ?

227
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,480
Why him !?

228
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,910
Why choose him ?

229
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:14,550
Whether it's talent, diligence or seniority,

230
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:15,950
he's not qualified !

231
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,200
What are you staring at ?

232
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,230
Master.

233
00:15:22,400 --> 00:15:26,270
This pill and bag of holding are gifts for you, my disciple.

234
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:29,910
It’s the tradition of the Heng Yue Sect.

235
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,950
Move along,

236
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:41,910
let's go back to work.

237
00:15:41,920 --> 00:15:43,710
Back to being lowly outer disciples...

238
00:15:49,520 --> 00:15:50,560
Senior Situ,

239
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:51,640
I did it !

240
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:56,200
Wang Lin
Heng Yue Sect disciple
1st layer of Qi Condensation

241
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:56,360
I've mastered the Attraction technique !

242
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:58,030
Don't get cocky.

243
00:15:58,640 --> 00:16:01,080
After cultivating in the Heaven Defying Bead for so long,

244
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:04,000
you’ve only barely reached the 1st layer of Qi Condensation.

245
00:16:04,120 --> 00:16:06,160
Only your Attraction technique

246
00:16:06,280 --> 00:16:07,120
is passable.

247
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:41,520
Note: 1 jin = 500g

248
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:39,470
Senior Brother Liu, we agreed on 100 jin of firewood.

249
00:16:39,680 --> 00:16:41,520
But now you’ve raised it to 1000 jin !

250
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:43,750
I, Zhang Hu, have bribed you well over these years.

251
00:16:43,760 --> 00:16:45,230
Are you really trying to expel me !?

252
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:49,310
At least 30% of the wood you chop is water.

253
00:16:49,720 --> 00:16:51,240
You’re slandering me !

254
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:52,510
Is it because

255
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,360
I saw Zhao Fugui gift you a talisman ?

256
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:57,110
Fine ! I’ll ask the Sect Leader about it !

257
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,310
Zhang Hu,

258
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,790
you forced me to do this !

259
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:12,110
Stupid mortal, do you think you’ll live to see the Sect Leader ?

260
00:17:27,720 --> 00:17:30,030
You already learned the Attraction technique ?

261
00:17:30,600 --> 00:17:32,830
We're disciples of the same sect so don’t go too far !

262
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:35,270
Are you lecturing me !?

263
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,200
Wang Lin, watch out !

264
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,550
Today is the day you die !

265
00:18:10,480 --> 00:18:11,750
You humiliated and bullied me,

266
00:18:11,800 --> 00:18:13,520
now you're trying to kill a disciple.

267
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,950
You must be punished !

268
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:26,550
You stupid ant, I’ll kill you !

269
00:18:55,380 --> 00:20:57,330
In the novel, Wang Lin returns home after failing the test. He then leaves during the night after writing a farewell letter to his parents and he tries to go back to the sect by himself. He then falls off a cliff and gets swallowed by the wind inside the cave where he finds the Heaven Defying Bead inside the stomach of a dead bird he was eating to survive. The suction force of the wind and his broken arm prevent him from escaping and he ends up staying there for multiple days. The whole part was cut but the consequences of it are still here with the characters thinking he attempted to kill himself.

It is important to understand that by soaking the Heaven Defying Bead in water, it absorbed spiritual energy of the water element and upgraded, thus allowing Wang Lin to cultivate inside it with the time acceleration.
The 5 elements of chinese feng shui are water, earth, fire, metal and wood. After seeing the bead absorb one element, Wang Lin guesses that he needs to complete all 5 to unlock the true power of the Heaven Defying Bead.

Spirit Roots were mentionned in the first 2 episodes, think of them as someone's potential for cultivation. They also have properties of the 5 elements.

This is also a good time to learn the different ranks of sect members. There might be variations but the most common hierarchy is this one :
Ancestor > Sect Leader > core disciple > Elder > inner disciple > outer disciple
There are some sects like here in Heng Yue where outer disciples are mortals but in better sects the outer disciples will be cultivators of low level.

